[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0091","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0106","title":"EasyCart 购物车应用隐藏表单字段敏感信息篡改漏洞","description":"EasyCart 购物车应用存在不安全隐藏表单字段漏洞，远程攻击者可通过修改表单中隐藏字段的值来篡改订单金额、商品数量等敏感购买信息，以低于正常价格甚至零成本完成交易。该漏洞源于服务端未对客户端提交的隐藏字段数据进行充分校验，影响使用 EasyCart 的在线购物网站。攻击者无需身份认证，仅通过浏览器即可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0106"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:00.797","remediation":"1. 立即升级 EasyCart 至官方发布的最新安全版本（如有）；2. 若已停止维护，须彻底移除 Hidden Form Fields 传递价格/金额的逻辑，改为服务端 Session 或数据库存储真实价格；3. 对所有提交的订单数据在服务端执行金额校验，禁止直接信任客户端传入的价格、数量等参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0106","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0106.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0106","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/edba2e8a11daaad31ff57bea0f9419186eb54326/2000/CVE-2000-0106.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0106.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bbc8c0a71659f005292a66be54d5a75a1b892d59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3q6q-m779-9qvh/GHSA-3q6q-m779-9qvh.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0106.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88290/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/158dea8303c58859521e12d6c7