9T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01.420","remediation":"升级 RightFax 至厂商已修复该问题的版本（如 RightFax 9.4 或更高版本），启用 Web 客户端安全会话模式，在服务器配置中将会话 ID 生成算法改为随机数而非顺序递增。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理并配置会话劫持防护规则，同时启用 HTTPS 加密传输防止会话 ID 被嗅探。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/953","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0111.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0111","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0111.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0111.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/35654e096c2a49809e9bb5907f49e27c931fdaa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xpxq-j6pj-5vxg/GHSA-xpxq-j6pj-5vxg.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0111.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001122.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/bfaf704c84438cafe15e6437a0f1a5a66dbac893/2000.tsv","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0117","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0130","title":"SCO scohelp 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 系统中的 scohelp 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够在受影响系统上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 SCO UnixWare 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议用户及时升级至厂商修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0130"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-27T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03.790","remediation":"立即升级到 SCO UnixWare 7.1.1 或更高版本，并安装 SCO 官方安全补丁 erg711903a；同时限制 scohelp 服务的访问来源，在防火墙或 hosts.allow 中仅允许受信任 IP 连接，禁用不必要的远程管理服务以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94908470928258&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0130.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0130","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0130.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0130.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2f2b600b6067347440c628428f80fe3f9e3c004e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-pqq3-v6fg-mvw9/GHSA-pqq3-v6fg-mvw9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83023/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0130.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/76ed5b243a5ac75f8d2d512d1de509d415e3e7ba/2000.tsv","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/e1fa268f46af70c043d8fa3850aa13f3adaa5831/advisories/2022/05/EUVD-2000-0129.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0097","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0113","title":"Sybergen SyGate 远程管理服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SyGate Remote Management 管理服务存在访问控制缺陷，未对管理端口进行适当身份验证限制，远程攻击者无需认证即可直接访问该管理服务，向目标系统发送特制请求可导致拒绝服务或获取网络流量统计等敏感信息。该漏洞影响 SyGate 多个版本，攻击者需能网络可达目标主机，危害等级高，建议及时升级或配置访问控制策略。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0113"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-27T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01.660","remediation":"升级 SyGate 至 4.0 以上版本，或在防火墙规则中限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问管理端口（默认 7323/TCP）。如无需远程管理功能，建议直接禁用 Remote Management 服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94934808714972&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94952641025328&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94973281714994&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/952","http://www.sybergen.com/support/fix.htm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0113.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0113","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0113.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0113.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/35654e096c2a49809e9bb5907f49e27c931fdaa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cj7c-7233-qrq9/GHSA-cj7c-7233-qrq9.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/sygate_remote_control.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0113.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bb58ccc3-e01d-425f-8257-bcd5c86c101f.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001120.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0082","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0098","title":"Microsoft Index Server 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Microsoft Index Server 2.0 存在信息泄露漏洞。当远程攻击者向目标 Web 服务器发送一个不存在的 Internet Data Query 文件（.idq 或 .ida）请求时，服务器返回的错误消息中会泄露 Web 目录在服务器上的真实物理路径。该漏洞源于索引服务器在处理文件请求时未对错误消息中的路径信息进行过滤，攻击者无需任何认证即可利用此漏洞获取服务器文件系统结构信息，为后续攻击提供侦察支撑。该漏洞不影响 Windows 2000 的 Indexing Services，除非管理员明确启动了该服务。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-006 中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0098"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.800","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-006 对应补丁（KB251170/KB252463）。如无需索引服务，建议在服务管理器中禁用 Index Server 服务并删除 IIS 中 .idq/.htw 脚本映射；同时配置 IIS 自定义错误页返回通用提示而非详细路径信息，防止路径泄漏。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-006","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0098.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0098.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0098","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0098.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0098.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b029cc6cdc62926be1ff123d5ca2faba44641d8e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q6jm-fjc7-97gj/GHSA-q6jm-fjc7-97gj.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/